  "aiContextParagraph": "The Football Association of Indonesia (PSSI) is currently restructuring its coaching staff for the national U-23 team. This decision comes shortly after reports indicated that John Herdman had been scouting young domestic talent for the upcoming SEA Games 2027 squad. PSSI officials stated that the change is necessary to manage the increasingly heavy competitive workload facing Indonesia's senior and youth national teams throughout the 2027 calendar year. While the transition in leadership is underway, the federation is expected to introduce a successor in the near future. The development follows a period of observation where coaches had been monitoring potential players for the regional tournament, aiming to build a competitive roster for the Indonesian football program despite the logistical demands of the upcoming season.",
